    "preamble": "B Dinkar vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 8 January, 2024 Author: Anand Pathak Bench: Anand Pathak 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Gwalior Before Hon'Ble Shri Justice Anand Pathak On The 8 th Of January, 2024 Misc. Criminal Case No. 38225 of 2023 Between:- 1. B Dinkar S/O Shri Neeraja Brung, Aged About 38 Years, Occupation: Service Nominee Laboratory In Charge In Food Pvt Ltd Unit Ii 7-3 112/1/1 Sy No 74P And 75P Madhuban Colony Kattenddan Hydrabad Presently Residing At Gulshan Vatika Phase I House No E-8 Housing Board Colony Sejbahar Near Main Gate Temple Raipur (Chhattisgarh) 2. Shishir Goyal S/O Shri Sharadchandra Goyal, Aged About 42 Years, Occupation: Business Proprietor Firm Nirmalchandra Sharad Goyal R/O Madhav Chowk Shankar Colony, Shivpuri (Madhya Pradesh) 3. Ajit Jain S/O Shri Dinesh Chandra Jain, Aged About 38 Years, Occupation: Business, Proprietor M/S Shanti Sales Shinde House Subhash Colony Guna R/O House Of Mama Garments, Choudharan Colony, Guna (Madhya Pradesh) .....Ap (By Shri Amit Saxena- Advocate) And 1. The State Of Madhya Pradesh Through Food Safety Officer Food Safety Administration District Guna Mp (Madhya Pradesh) 2. C O M M I S S I O N E R Food Safety And Controller, Food And Drugs Ad M In Is Tr Ation Edgah Hills Bhopal (Madhya Pradesh) B Dinkar vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 8 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/41237676/ 1 Signature Not Verified Signed by: VISHAL UPADHYAY Signing time: 08-01-2024 07:02:54 PM 2 (BY SHRI RAJEEV UPADHYAY- GOVERNMENT ADVOCATE FOR RESPONDENT/STATE) This application coming on for admission this day, t following: ORDER Instant petition has been filed under Section 482 of Cr.P.C.",
